## With Docker

```bash
docker compose -f docker-compose.override.yml up --build
```

That builds the image from `Dockerfile`, starts Postgres and the service with the in-memory message
bus, and publishes the service on <http://localhost:[[ port ]]>. The build needs the package mirror
and base images as build arguments (see the comments in `Dockerfile`: [[ build_args | join(", ") ]]);
export them before you run the command.

* Health (no token): <http://localhost:[[ port ]]/health>

